WEBVTT

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.450
You can stop now.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.720
<b>Episode 4 Important Friends</b>

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:05.610
Get in.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.370
S-Sorry.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:19.760
You're unbelievable.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.270
Wouldn't you normally flee now?

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:27.190
Yeah, you're right. Normally you would.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.370
But I wonder why.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.500
I don't really understand it myself, but...

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:38.910
Isn't that yours? I picked it up for you.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.820
Thanks.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.430
Where are we going?

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.280
A hideout no one knows about.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.270
I can't trust Haysin anymore,

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:54.720
and I made the dumb decision 
to promise I'd protect you.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.570
Unbelievable. What a willful boy.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.890
No matter.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:12.420
I'll be exterminating vermin 
with a dear old doll.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.390
Ton.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.820
It's so late already.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.530
What's up?

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.940
Did you just wake up?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.760
No, I was doing research in the study.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.140
About your powers, huh?

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:59.130
Yeah, something like that.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.490
But there's too much to read.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:05.550
Folklore from all places and ages, 
historical weapons...

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.290
Oh, thanks.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:11.850
There were three books on Toryu alone.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.730
I was surprised.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.890
Apparently Rijan experienced 
some trial and error with Toryu.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.190
What does that mean?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.450
Anyway, about the search for your friend...

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.450
Oh, right. Did you figure something out?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.420
Unfortunately, we haven't.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:32.490
I searched all the security cameras 
in town, but there's no sign of her.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:33.910
Sorry.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.160
It's okay.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:39.170
You've been taking such good care of me,
 I have nothing to complain about.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.760
You're even letting me 
stay here free of charge.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:47.010
You must want something sweet 
after staring at books all day.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.850
Vanilla ice cream?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.990
Close.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.230
I'm about to add the magic 
of espresso to that.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.190
Affogato al caffè.

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.940
Are you trying to defile my tea?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.520
You're ruining the aroma of the tea!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.150
Why would you serve that now?

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.670
It's delicious.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.740
You don't understand delicate aromas.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.320
By delicate, you mean inconsequential 
differences, right?

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:16.480
This. These kinds of remarks.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.070
We lose customers because they're 
always acting like that.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.690
This is the problem with savage beasts.

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:18.710
That doesn't surprise me.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.290
Lady Ton.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.260
As Lady Rijan's descendant,
 I find your behavior problematic.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.970
Huh? What's problematic?

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.300
Spoons aren't meant to be held in your mouth.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.760
It calls your character into question.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.220
And that hairstyle.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:37.070
It may be fine in the study, 
but in the presence of others,

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.440
Rijan always dressed properly.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.260
Which included her clothes, of course.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.810
You're right. Rijan was always dressed 
neatly in the presence of others.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:53.370
Even in battle, she was elegant.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.530
That's a bit close.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.470
You do look like the photos of Rijan...

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:01.920
But is this elegant?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.940
Sorry to disappoint you.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.920
But Shinyao says I'm prettier than anyone—

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.150
I'm sorry.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.330
I dirtied your clothing.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.410
Excuse me.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.320
Hey, you okay?

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.090
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.640
Thanks, Toryu.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:32.200
Wait!

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:33.780
No way! Your hand!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.710
Don't worry. It's not a problem.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.890
I am not a person, but a tool.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.020
Don't feel like you need 
to be respectful with me.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:45.030
In any case, wait here.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.270
Lady Ton, you should change.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.480
This comes first.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:00.980
That should do it.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.750
You're terrible at that.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.280
Shut up, peanut gallery.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.890
I'll go get changed.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.310
We wouldn't want it to stain.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.240
I'll send it out for cleaning immediately.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.680
This old rag? That's okay.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:17.600
I also need to go shopping.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.820
Don't worry about it.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:21.560
Really? In that case, let's go together.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:22.960
I'll carry our things.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.670
It'll be hard with that hand.

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:27.290
It's not a problem.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.630
I want to thank you.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.540
We'll be back.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.770
It's like they're going on a date.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.120
Huh? Does that bother you guys?

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.990
Toryu doesn't bother me.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.730
He'd never make a move on her.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.110
Unlike someone else.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:59.600
Since you're so worried about her,
 I'll let you watch.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.230
<i>Well? Can you see?</i>

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.880
That's a crisp image.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.820
Unbelievable. This is in poor taste.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:18.260
Toryu, I noticed you have 
a talisman over your eyes.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.560
What is it? Can you see?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.250
Lady Rijan gave me this talisman.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.980
It allows me to control myself.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.850
Control?

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.410
To answer your other question, 
I can't see with this talisman over my eyes.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:35.610
However...

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:41.870
Please don't do that with a face 
that looks like Lady Rijan's.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.330
You totally can see!

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:45.220
Unbelievable.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.290
What's this?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:52.510
A bird?

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:53.840
At night?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.060
Are you all right?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.510
Were those Umbra?

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:13.230
Yes. They're conjured creatures.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.240
There must be a sorcerer nearby.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.200
What?

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.410
No way!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.120
L-Lady Ton!

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:45.890
Darn bird!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.850
Let go of me!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.400
As you wish!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.080
Huh?

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.910
Never mind! Don't let go!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.410
Such a noisy girl.

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.470
Thanks.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.210
You're always causing trouble.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:12.160
The Twilights again.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.210
They're always getting in my way,

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:18.260
but that ends tonight.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:22.480
They won't be able to stop that jiangshi 
once he reverts to his true form.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.850
You okay, Toryu?

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:26.240
Jeez.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.850
This isn't like you.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.270
Is that...?

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.110
Toryu?

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:53.880
This is what those birds were after.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.980
Toryu, what's wrong?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.720
Rijan's talisman was removed.

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:58.530
What?

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.180
So that's...

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:03.760
What?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:07.760
What's happening to Toryu?

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.630
That's the real Toryu.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.360
That can't be possible.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.450
He's an Umbra weapon designed 
to rampage behind enemy lines

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.100
before eventually exploding.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.910
No way. But until now...

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:26.150
That can't be good.

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:28.250
He's attacking everything that moves.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:32.580
Isn't there something I can do, like before?

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:36.200
No. You can't use that power repeatedly.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.050
Maybe we should use her power.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.620
If he's not stopped, the damage will spread.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.890
It can't be helped.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.700
Okay. In that case...

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:52.100
Imagine what you want and make a strong wish.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:56.280
That should be enough for your 
blood and the ring to respond.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.020
We need a talisman that can suppress Toryu.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.110
Got it. I'll give it a shot.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.480
Do a good job.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.710
If you can't do it, 
we'll have to give up on Toryu.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.530
Wayne, get a sense of the surroundings.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.190
Luke, let's buy some time.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:17.750
Lead him someplace deserted, huh?

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:27.260
After all that big talk, I can't fail now.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.170
It's okay. I can do it.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.890
I'm sure I can.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.340
Give me a talisman to 
suppress Toryu's power.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:43.070
That jiangshi was created to 
take on a company of soldiers.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.180
How well can they do against him?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.540
Over here, Toryu!

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.600
Can Ton pull this off?

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:01.920
If she can't, we'll have 
to prepare for the worst.

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.180
I did it!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.070
It's just like the one that was in the book.

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.240
You just wait, Toryu.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.300
Did you finish making the talisman?

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.440
Of course.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.490
Way to go.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:23.570
This way.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.610
Follow me.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.720
This is pretty tough.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.060
Ton.

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:42.920
Luke, here.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.510
This should work.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.270
He's coming.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.630
Ton, stand back.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:07.780
Gotcha.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.070
He's prepared to go down with him.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:22.300
Good, Toryu. That's how you should fight.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.660
Now they—

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:29.320
That was close.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.820
A-Are you okay?

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.380
My leg suffered a little damage,
 but I dodged it.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.370
I see.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.020
What about the talisman?

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.890
I stuck it on him, of course.

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.480
We should be fine now.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:51.840
What?

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.380
It didn't work?

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:54.210
I don't know.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.580
It seemed to be working,

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.830
but this is the end.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.540
Wait. Does that mean 
you're going to kill him?

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.060
Isn't he your friend?

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.210
I'll make another talisman.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.280
Don't.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.260
It'll end the same way.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.960
Can you fight him yourself?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.870
He's just a moving arsenal right now.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:13.980
I'll manage.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:16.060
Don't call him that!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.110
Toryu... Toryu is...

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:23.480
<i>Earlier I created a talisman 
to suppress his power.</i>

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:27.440
<i>But that's not what Toryu needs.</i>

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.080
<i>He really needs...</i>

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.930
We've known each other a hundred years.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.340
I never thought it would end like this.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:36.120
It's not over yet.

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:43.110
The talisman Toryu needs, 
and the talisman I want to give him, is this!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.350
That's different from the 
one you made earlier.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.990
You're confident it'll work?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:51.590
Yes.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.090
The earlier one was meant 
to suppress his power.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.210
But this one...

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.720
It's okay. I'll stick it on him.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:09.220
Don't. We don't even know if it'll work.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.710
More than anything, you're not Rijan.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.820
Who says I can't, just because 
I'm not my great-grandmother?

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:17.270
Can or can't, you don't know until you try.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:21.660
And I'll decide if I'll try or not.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.850
Ton, save him.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:30.300
I don't want to lose my friend here.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.460
Watch out!

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:52.860
That's not good!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.200
Run, Ton!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:00.540
Lady Rijan...

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:09.860
You're not a tool.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:14.800
You never wanted to do this.

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:22.470
Haysin may have created you 
to be a tool and a weapon,

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.150
but that's not how I see you.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:27.690
So...

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.480
I'll give you a heart.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:35.130
See? You're not a tool anymore.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:36.920
Toryu.

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:39.320
Toryu.

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:42.720
Do you understand me?

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.820
The talisman...

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.620
But how?

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:50.320
We can't have you exploding in the city.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.340
You've already done plenty
 of damage, though.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.550
Think Detective Gregory can cover this up?

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.970
I'm sorry. How should I be punished?

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.500
You should thank Ton.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:06.010
She created and stuck the talisman on you.

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.690
For me? But I'm only a tool.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:14.240
If you were just a tool,
 I wouldn't have tried so hard.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.390
This isn't a talisman to suppress your power.

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:20.070
It gives you a heart.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:23.240
A-A heart? Why?

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:26.810
I don't know what my 
great-grandmother thought,

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:30.080
but I couldn't think of you as a tool.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.190
If I had to choose, you're...

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:38.300
a friend, I think.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.010
Yeah, a friend.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.650
A friend.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.730
That's right.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:48.280
You're not a tool. 
You're a friend with a heart.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.560
That's what we believe. So...

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:54.270
it's only natural we saved you.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:56.080
Lady Ton...

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:14.050
Nothing's guaranteed to go my way,

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:16.590
but I gained something.

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.540
That girl...

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.800
If Rijan's blood has 
awakened this much already,

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.520
then with a little more effort...

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.840
M-Mr. Toryu?

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:42.110
Lady Ton, we're no longer strangers.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:43.950
Please just call me Toryu.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.510
Toryu, I—

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.970
There's nothing to worry about.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.920
Let me handle everything.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.800
That's not what I meant.

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:06.810
I can handle it myself.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:12.210
From now on, I shall assist you with 
all matters concerning your appearance.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:14.610
I'm not a child.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:18.670
He's been acting like that since 
the incident the other day.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.390
But Toryu's cool, right?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:22.360
Not my problem.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:28.080
There's no way Rijan was so 
neat because of Toryu, right?

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.090
What?

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.790
No, that's not...

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.130
Do you need something?

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:09.500
Hey, what are we going to do about that?

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.100
Ah, oops.

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:12.980
I nearly forgot.

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:14.860
Ton.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.700
Is that a store apron for me?

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:19.230
Yes.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:23.960
I see. Now I'm one of you.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:27.490
Starting today, you're our manager.

00:22:27.770 --> 00:22:28.380
Huh?

00:22:30.020 --> 00:22:30.610
What?

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:33.610
What?!

00:22:35.160 --> 00:23:32.050
<b>Phantom Twilight 
Plus</b>

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:37.590
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:43.870
This time we'll be introducing the true 
runaway train of the Twilights, Toryu!

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:46.340
I am terribly sorry about 
the trouble I caused.

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:48.430
I shall atone for my crimes 
by self-destructing.

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.760
That's what you call a runaway train!

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:54.110
Normally I'm the cool
 and collected brains of the team,

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:57.500
but when my talisman is 
removed, I lose control.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.560
Toryu is a jiangshi.

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:03.730
Normally they're like puppets, 
created by animating corpses.

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.960
But in my case, Lady Rijan's 
special spell gave me life,

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:09.610
turning me into an Umbra 
with a sense of self.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:11.570
His weapons are primarily firearms.

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:15.480
But how do you carry such big guns around?

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:16.790
By using magic.

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.090
But Gatling guns clearly wouldn't 
fit inside your sleeves.

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:21.840
By using magic.

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:24.460
Don't probe for details.

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.430
W-Well, whatever.

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:29.280
So, how do you get your weapons?

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:32.290
I submit my required expenses 
to the Twilights, and...

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:34.890
<b>Necessary
 Expenses</b>

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.020
You don't use magic for that?

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:50.010
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:38.020
Lady Ton is made manager of Café Forbidden.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:41.100
Her first job is finding an Umbra lover.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.580
Despite running in circles, 
the new manager still tries her best,

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:48.060
but the appearance of a surprising person 
takes the story in an unexpected direction.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.010
<b>Episode 5 The Fairy's Lover</b>

00:23:48.060 --> 00:23:50.020
Next time: The Fairy's Lover.
